ame":"Sean Bell","party":"One Nation","person_id":"tvfy_11062","person_slug":"sean-bell","vote":"no"},{"name":"Slade Brockman","party":"DPRES","person_id":"tvfy_10900","person_slug":"slade-brockman","vote":"no"},{"name":"Steph Hodgins-May","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_11020","person_slug":"steph-hodgins-may","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Sue Lines","party":"PRES","person_id":"tvfy_10782","person_slug":"sue-lines","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Susan McDonald","party":"Nationals","person_id":"tvfy_10951","person_slug":"susan-mcdonald","vote":"no"},{"name":"Tammy Tyrrell","party":"Independent","person_id":"tvfy_11012","person_slug":"tammy-tyrrell","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Tony Sheldon","party":"Labor","person_id":"tvfy_10944","person_slug":"tony-sheldon","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Tyron Whitten","party":"One Nation","person_id":"tvfy_11060","person_slug":"tyron-whitten","vote":"no"},{"name":"Varun Ghosh","party":"Labor","person_id":"tvfy_11017","person_slug":"varun-ghosh","vote":"aye"}],"name":"Business — Consideration of Legislation","noes":26,"question":"Michaelia Cash I seek leave to move a motion relating to the consideration of the Treasury Laws Amendment (Removing the Widows and Spouses Tax) Bill 2026 as circulated. Leave not granted. Pursuant to contingent notice standing in my name, I move: That so much of the standing orders be suspended as would prevent me moving a motion to provide for the consideration of a matter, namely a motion to give precedence to a motion relating to the consideration of the Treasury Laws Amendment (Removing the Widows and Spouses Tax) Bill 2026. I have to say this is possibly one of the most urgent suspensions to ever come before the Australian Senate. The Albanese government openly admit that they have imposed a tax on women escaping domestic violence. They now openly admit that they have imposed a tax on Australians going through divorce and relationship breakdowns. They have openly admitted this. They know they have a problem. They stand up here day after day telling us how they are the party for women in this country, yet they then sit back and are emasculated when it comes to bringing in a change to this. Well, guess what? The opposition is going to help the government. We have today introduced into the parliament the Treasury Laws Amendment (Removing the Widows and Spouses Tax) Bill 2026. It is a very, very simple bill. It basically cleans up the mess that the government itself has created. The government has had Tuesday of this week. The government has had Wednesday of this week. The government has had today, Thursday, of this week to introduce a bill to clean up its mess. It has sat on its hands and it has done nothing. All the Senate now has to do is agree to this suspension so that, at three o'clock today, we will not interrupt any government business time. We will end question time in an orderly way. We will then join together as the Senate to debate the bill that has now been introduced into the Australian Senate and, after 30 minutes, do you know what we'll do? The Labo","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-10666","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2026-08-13/7"}
